abstract: >-
  This research archive develops the Tri-Layer Architecture and Ambient
  Alignment Sync framework for long-horizon human-AI interaction. The series
  focuses on role separation, continuity, bounded archive reconstruction, and
  durable human-governed research workflows. It does not make AI-consciousness
  claims.
